<p>Bonjour,</p>
<p>{{ customer_name | html.escape }} ({{ customer_email | html.escape }}) a passé la commande {{ order.number | html.escape }} le {{ order.date | html.escape }}.</p>
<p>Articles :</p>
<ul>
{{- for line in order.lines }}
<li>{{ line.label | html.escape }} : {{ line.price | html.escape }}</li>
{{- end }}
</ul>
<p>Total : {{ order.total | html.escape }}</p>
<p>Livraison à :<br>
{{ order.recipient | html.escape }}<br>
{{- for address_line in order.address_lines }}
{{ address_line | html.escape }}<br>
{{- end }}
Téléphone : {{ order.phone | html.escape }}</p>
{{- if order.comment }}
<p>Commentaire du client : {{ order.comment | html.escape }}</p>
{{- end }}
<p>Pour traiter la commande, ouvrez le lien ci-dessous.</p>
<p><a href="{{ order_url | html.escape }}">{{ order_url | html.escape }}</a></p>
